│ y_in = 0.    │
│ z_in = 0.    │
│ t_in = 0.    │
│ ──────── Test #2 ──────
│ x_in = -0.25 │ o = -1.
│ y_in = -0.5  │
│ z_in = 0.    │
│ t_in = -0.5  │
└─
```
